    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970422.0638\n\nLIMA, April 22 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT Japanese ambassador among freed hostages\n\n\n\n\nJapanese Ambassador Morihisa Aoki was among the hostages freed Tuesday when Peruvian troops stormed his official residence where he an 71 others had been held hostage for 18 weeks.",
